  <text>
    <body>
      <div type="clause" n="4">
        <head><ref type="lawCode" target="law:VIIAtr">VII Atr</ref> 4</head>
        <ab type="selectedText" xml:lang="und">Et praecipimus, ut omnis homo super dileccionem Die et omnium sanctorum det cyricsceattum et rectam decimam suam, sicut in diebus antecessorum nostrorum stetit, quando melius stetit—hoc est sicut aratrum peragrabit per decimam acram.</ab>
        <ab type="translation" xml:lang="en">And we decree that all men, for love of God and all the saints, shall give their church-dues and their rightful tithes in accordance with the best observed in the days of our ancestors, namely, [the produce of] every tenth acre traversed by the plough.</ab>
      </div>
    </body>
